RESPONSIBLE-USE NOTICE (not a modification of the license above)

This dataset contains real examples of hate speech and profanity, provided
strictly for research and educational purposes in hate-speech detection and
content moderation. By using this dataset you agree NOT to use it to harass,
profile, defame, or otherwise harm any individual or community, and NOT to
attempt to re-identify the authors of any comment.
